  "description": "🟩🟩🟩🟩🟩🟩\n(ACTIVE 2/22/26) \n🟩🟩🟩🟩🟩🟩\n\n(Requirements to join)\n\n✔️ Combat level 40\n\n\n————————————————————————\n\n🪦🪦🪦🪦 Welcome to Grave Walkers! 🪦🪦🪦🪦\n\nWe are a US East guild looking for active players, \nno discord required (is optional though). \n\nComplete challenges for marks and EXP! Marks \nare used for raids and will conduct them as much \nas possible! Please contribute what you can into \nthe stockpile to build the guild hall. \n\nA guild hall has many useful tools such as a Raid \nPlanner (to schedule multiple raids), Teleportation \nBeacon, Mission Table, Unity Seal, Energizing Pool, \nand most excitingly, a conquest banner! We will all \nbenefit from a guild hall so donate what you can!\n\nWe&#039;ll be doing only event raids for the current \nevent! Make sure to take advantage of our raids \nand check guild Raid times!\n\n————————————————————————\n\n⏰⏰⏰⏰ RAID SCHEDULE ⏰⏰⏰⏰\n \n 🔔 8:00 am EST\n\n 🔔 2:00 pm EST\n\n 🔔 8:00 pm EST (Main Raid time)\n\n————————————————————————",
